 oduction or training.\n\nOrganisation: Fondation Vocatio\nLocation: Brusse
 ls\, Belgium. RESTRICTED: Belgian nationals\, or persons domiciled in Belg
 ium and resident there for at least 5 years\; aged over 18 and under 35 on
  31 December of the application year.\nAward: EUR 10\,000 bourse per laure
 ate\, funding a concrete personal project (equipment\, production\, traini
 ng). No application fee.\nDuration: Per project\n\nMore: https://www.vocat
 io.be/fr/pose-ta-candidature?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_med
