 ossibility
DESCRIPTION:Closes 16 Nov 2026 at 23:59 GMT.\n\nOnline incubator from Swiss
  foundation Unearthodox (formerly the Luc Hoffmann Institute) for innovato
 rs with early-stage ideas at the intersection of environmental and societa
 l challenges\, aimed at work that tackles root causes in the relationship 
 between people\, society and nature rather than symptoms: climate\, biodiv
 ersity\, habitat loss\, regeneration and environmental justice among them.
 \n\nOrganisation: Unearthodox\nLocation: Online\; group sessions designed 
 around time zones UTC-6 to UTC+6. Open worldwide to applicants over 18\; a
 pplications in English.\nAward: CHF 10\,000 grant per selected initiative\
 , plus a 10-month incubation programme with tailored coaching\, expert sup
 port\, peer learning\, systems mapping and futures-thinking support. No ap
 plication fee.\nDuration: 10 months\, 1 March to 31 December 2027\n\nMore:
  https://unearthodox.org/2026/09/open-call-edges-of-possibility-exploratio
 n-co-lab-2027/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
